# Runtime artifacts. These carry live operational data -- the integrity chain
# logs MAC addresses and per-run traces, and the TX/plan files carry deposit
# addresses, memos, XMR destinations and subaddress indices. Committing any of
# them would publish exactly what this toolchain exists to keep private.
integrity_chain.log
*.unsigned
*.signed
unsigned/
tx_staging/
signed_manifest_v1.json
unsigned_manifest.json
thor_pairs_batch.json*
exitplan_v1.json
wallet_*.json
prog*.json
.venv/
